<title>USA: Cidco names Daniel Eilers president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Cidco names Daniel Eilers president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MORGAN HILL, Calif. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cidco Inc said Thursday it had appointed Daniel Eilers, 41, as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Most recently, Eilers served as president and chief executive of NAT Systems International Inc, a privately-held software company.</p>
<p>Cidco did not identify its previous president and CEO.</p>
